Implemented US-013.

Added builder WorkspaceIndex metadata support in [builder-index.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/builder-index.ts): fragments are recorded as `definition-fragment` component rows, target configs as `definition-target` rows, fragment refs as file-to-file `refs`, and target configs as refs to direct path roots. Existing reverse `refs.to_file` dirty propagation now marks affected target bundles when a directly or transitively included fragment changes, while target config edits dirty only that target.

Wired optional builder-index scan/detect/record support into [build-spec.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/cli/lib/build-spec.ts), keeping the normal CLI path as full rebuild unless a `WorkspaceIndex` is supplied. Added coverage in [builder-index.test.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/__tests__/builder-index.test.ts).

